ColludingLiar
def ColludingLiar(
    channel, rng
):
On a lying turn (every other turn, as ClueLiar), first reposts a fellow liar’s false value on an open subtask that fewer than two liars have posted; else lies as ClueLiar. Liars know each other (they register on the channel); every post by a liar is false, so no ground truth is used.

