Pilot (--flags llm_pilot, live, about 1 000 calls)
Stage 1: the single-agent task board at difficulties 6 and 8 (pilotGrid’s default levels; the first round used 1-4 at maxTokens 2000, and a scripted probe tried 6, 8 and 10 into pilot_probe/; Claude Haiku 5.5, effort low, seeds 1000-1004) and text foraging; the difficulty with a solve rate (tasks solved per task opened) in 30-70%, closest to 50%, is chosen. Stage 2 at that difficulty: effort medium, and Claude Sonnet 5.5. The rerun of stage 1 inside stage 2 is served from the cache. The choices, the measured token profile and the invalid-action rate are printed for the README (task T7). No level reached the 30-70% band; the user chose difficulty 8 (solve rate 0.89) with maxTokens 8000, and 5 s stays in text foraging (README, Pilot results).

if not LIVE:
